WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.757
The learning outcomes explain what you will practise In

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:05.757
this learning unit you will prepare a clear working

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:10.021
agreement and a reasoned decision brief The outcomes below

00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:13.139
describe the capabilities that the teaching and practice will

00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:17.060
help you develop Your practice drafts are not evidence

00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:19.876
of formal competence until they have been reviewed through

00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:24.113
the authorised assessment process What will be expected of

00:00:24.139 --> 00:00:27.021
you in this LU In this learning activity you

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.797
will explain one improvement attempt retrieval and plan how

00:00:30.876 --> 00:00:34.836
to revisit and transfer the learning Outcomes linked to

00:00:34.889 --> 00:00:39.705
this activity EA-01 . 1 Translate an executive brief

00:00:39.744 --> 00:00:46.389
into agreed support priorities deliverables and review points EA-01

00:00:46.455 --> 00:00:50.363
. 2 Prepare a working agreement covering diary access

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:57.481
decision and spending limits communication preferences confidentiality personal tasks

00:00:57.547 --> 00:01:03.757
and availability EA-01 . 3 Distinguish EA responsibilities from

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:07.665
those of a personal assistant office manager chief of

00:01:07.731 --> 00:01:11.244
staff and specialist adviser and refer work outside the

00:01:11.284 --> 00:01:17.560
agreed mandate EA-01 . 4 Present options and consequences

00:01:17.599 --> 00:01:22.573
when demands compete including effects on preparation time cost

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:29.100
wellbeing and required protective decisions EA-01 . 5 Agree

00:01:29.152 --> 00:01:33.389
a safe route for raising concerns resolving expectations and

00:01:33.389 --> 00:01:37.034
arranging an authorised deputy without making the role dependent

00:01:37.099 --> 00:01:41.875
on permanent availability Learning practice and acknowledgement are not

00:01:41.927 --> 00:01:44.743
an assessor result or workplace authorisation
